# See https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/getting-started-with-git/ignoring-files for more about ignoring files.

# compiled output
dist
tmp
out-tsc
*.tsbuildinfo
.expo
.expo-shared

# generated map data shards (rebuilt from public/data/trees.geojson by
# artifacts/park-pulse/scripts/shard-trees.mjs on every dev/build)
artifacts/park-pulse/public/data/trees/

# Canopy rasters stay out of git: the layer is licence-gated and its source is
# 900 MB of LGA packages, so nothing here can regenerate it in a clone anyway.
artifacts/park-pulse/public/data/canopies/

# The council boundaries, transport stops and per-council tree shards ARE
# tracked (~10 MB). They are derived, but they are the site's runtime data and
# their raw sources are 1.3 GB of archives that cannot ship: without them a
# fresh clone fails build-catalog's integrity gate and the Netlify build emits
# a site with no council scope and no transit. This is the explicit gate that
# PRD §3.7-5 requires. Rebuild them with build-councils.mjs and gtfs-convert.mjs
# when the raw Data/ tree is present; the scripts only overwrite what they can
# derive.

# dependencies
node_modules

# IDEs and editors
/.idea
.project
.classpath
.c9/
*.launch
.settings/
*.sublime-workspace

# IDE - VSCode
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

# misc
/.sass-cache
/connect.lock
/coverage
/libpeerconnection.log
npm-debug.log
yarn-error.log
testem.log
/typings

# System Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

.cursor/rules/nx-rules.mdc
.github/instructions/nx.instructions.md

# Replit
.cache/
.local/

# Raw upstream downloads (1.3 GB of zips, GTFS feeds and tree exports). Reconstructed with
# the scripts named in DATA_INVENTORY.md; provenance is committed there, bytes are not.
/Data/

# Local tunnelling config for previewing :4173 (and any tunnel credential that lands here)
.cloudflared/

# Scratch review output: screenshots and one-off browser probes. Curated evidence lives in
# artifacts/park-pulse/docs/superpowers/ instead.
artifacts/park-pulse/review/
artifacts/park-pulse/scripts/.[a-z]*.mjs
artifacts/redesign-screens/

# Browser accessibility snapshots captured while debugging a flow. Never committed: they are
# scratch output and can contain account or session text.
/login-page.yml

# Generated data artifacts, rebuilt by the app's dev/build scripts (build-stats,
# build-catalog, build-hero-plate, build-contribution-index). Provenance is committed in
# DATA_INVENTORY.md; the bytes are not the record.
artifacts/park-pulse/public/data/stats.json
artifacts/park-pulse/public/data/catalog.json
artifacts/park-pulse/public/data/hero-plate.json
artifacts/park-pulse/public/data/contribution-index.json

# Stray build output written to the repo root by an extraction script run from the wrong
# directory. The app's own data lives under artifacts/park-pulse/public/data/.
/public/data/

